  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "This doesn't occur on every frame, but it appears as if line-shaped noise is randomly generated from different locations on various frames. It doesn't happen in specific worlds, but only when a user draws something using a pen provided in any world. The symptoms disappear once the drawing made with the pen is erased.",
